"智能适配屏幕按视频比例选择合适大小；记住上次窗口大小会恢复手动调整的尺寸；原始尺寸以实际像素 1:1 为目标，过大时缩小到屏幕内。" = "Fit to screen follows the video aspect ratio. Remember restores your last manual size. Original size targets 1:1 pixels and fits oversized videos to the screen.";
"手动调整后，同一窗口后续视频保持大小；同组标签页共用尺寸。设置对之后打开的视频或新窗口生效。" = "After manual resizing, subsequent videos keep that window size. Grouped tabs share their size. This setting applies to newly opened videos or windows.";
"默认开启。关闭最后一个播放窗口或标签页会彻底退出，Settings 也会关闭。关闭此选项后，应用继续在后台运行，可通过 Dock 再次打开播放器。" = "Enabled by default. Closing the last player window or tab quits the app, including Settings. Disable to keep the app running in the background and reopen it from the Dock.";
"默认使用单个窗口。开启后，打开新文件会创建独立播放窗口，各窗口可同时播放；拖入已有窗口则替换该窗口的视频。关闭选项不会自动关闭已有窗口。" = "Uses one window by default. Enable to open files in independent players that can play simultaneously. Dropping media into a window replaces its video. Disabling does not close existing windows.";
"优先同名 SRT、ASS、SSA，其次匹配语言后缀。可将字幕拖入视频区域，或点击控制栏的字幕按钮加载、切换和关闭字幕。" = "Matches SRT, ASS and SSA files by basename, then by language suffix. Drop a subtitle onto the video or use the subtitle button to load, switch or disable subtitles.";
"再次打开同一文件时从上次位置继续。播放结束或点击停止后从头播放。记录保存在应用的持久配置中，关闭此选项后不读取或更新记录。" = "Resume the same file from its last position. Finished or stopped videos start from the beginning. History is stored persistently; disabling this stops reading and updating it.";
"记忆模式会保存最近一次调整的音量，包括静音；首次使用为 70%。固定模式使用指定初始值，不覆盖之前的记忆记录。" = "Remember saves your most recently adjusted volume, including mute; the first-use level is 70%. Fixed uses the specified initial volume without overwriting the remembered value.";
"仅影响之后创建的播放窗口。已有窗口音量互不联动，同一窗口切换视频保留当前音量。" = "Applies to new player windows. Existing windows have independent volume, which is retained when changing videos in the same window.";
"开启后，播放器失焦时，第一次点击播放区域只激活窗口，不改变播放状态；再次点击才播放或暂停。适用于播放与暂停状态。" = "When inactive, the first click on the video activates the window without changing playback. Click again to play or pause. Applies during playback and while paused.";
"播放或暂停、聚焦或失焦时，均可按住播放区域拖动窗口，不改变播放状态；全屏时不可拖动。" = "Drag the video area to move the window, playing or paused, active or inactive, without changing playback. Unavailable in full screen.";
"鼠标停在控制栏上或正在操作按钮、滑块时，控制栏保持显示。" = "Controls stay visible while hovering over them or using a button or slider.";
"默认为深色模式。选择跟随系统后，外观会随 macOS 自动切换。" = "Dark is the default. Follow System automatically matches the macOS appearance.";
"主题应用于播放器和 Settings；视频画面及其黑边保持原样。" = "Theme applies to the player and Settings. Video and letterboxing keep their original appearance.";
